# NORVAL DYNAMO — a KSAB afternoon feature, Sunday 16:00 block.
#
# In-universe: a small, dry, extremely slow comedy about a teenager in the Ashway
# who is not good at anything except the two things nobody scores. Shot on one
# camera that never moves by a man who owned one camera. It was screened once at
# the Ashway community hall in 2081 and then not again for nine years.
#
# The joke is never explained and nobody in it knows they are funny. Every scene is
# held four seconds too long on purpose. That is the picture.
#
# A film is a RECORDING — the cast are DISPLAY NAMES in ::cast, never npc_ ids, so
# nothing here spawns a studio NPC and nothing presence-gates.
# See docs/bsm-format.md.

::cast
NORVAL | Norval Dynamo | has a lot of skills
KIPP | Kipp Dynamo | is training to be a cage fighter
DUTCH | Uncle Dutch | threw it in '71
GRAN | Gran Dynamo | out on the tailings
TEO | Teo Sandoval | new
DEB | Debra Wick | keychains, portraits
CLAW | Claw Vance | Vance Combat Systems
LAFONDA | LaFonda | on the relay
SUMMER | Summer Ostrand | current Block Steward
DON | Don Grebe | shoves people
COACH | Warden Peale | runs the hall
TINA | Tina | a goat, mostly
::endcast

::asset norval_dynamo_title
